{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban social media and smartphone use for under 16s",
        "additional_details": "We believe children deserve more time for real friendships, outdoor play, family, sport, creativity and learning \u2014 not endless scrolling. We want the Government to help protect childhood from the harms of smartphones and social media. We support age restrictions for under-16s to help promote real-life connections, play, sport and wellbeing.",
        "background": "We want to Put Childhood Before the Scroll and  Campaign for a safer childhood by calling ion the Government to ban smartphone and social media use for under-16s.",
